hFIlEHVuSS8Q7kNvwH-nc7U&_nc_oc=AdowV9IVJAiMjbdaTwND28f3qwAmh7d0NsW4zdW7OffKm22GFQ3XbeyE0X58XoI_wTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5lp96i9BrYeqbSldZ0k7dbuzeRcjT2XcpBxwaWZJyDUQ&oe=69FB4CB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xs-v710cteIQ7kNvwGS8o12&_nc_oc=Adp6d5nOevlP3b1pSTWX3NYHJc3VP6tb7-OxqJlysFfg5xwB7E4V4UEzMo-sJ-vetqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af41Q6O_5IHOeYL7OJ_iFb2oJeAWofe5M0zv8IIHYAv8SQ&oe=69FB4E4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4JZn1W8r7ugQ7kNvwHsRHLZ&_nc_oc=Adqyfjm2D-rULnUQGVahAwCu4XlK9MJ9hu9Uj6DQ2YT0dGjdKEhN975geOGBNtLYzTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7nxUmjIVOLatQLurkyRGdvHnTuMoeYnDphGQrAbgl-Tg&oe=69FB3B6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZuhM-o3GDzUQ7kNvwEJhC0G&_nc_oc=AdoCxO7Cqzx3TSSym2iDF8v3CtfIQQ9f-kpfDHlvVotMoZj6BqPvo3nHwXbPHV2to0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7W5AxP5tpf0ypQYSaO3jEBoFE_HcylUsYA8RQegck6Zg&oe=69FB5D03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIEHhAIMS6kQ7kNvwHOge7g&_nc_oc=AdorYsutbvIUPJD7Y7ZP55uEurB5AFVjSPGWSLzJSGIgo2ZYaEsy3vFYfsNxCPkts2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6O9KX2eE7WsrGXfh3uG7m8Dm6M-Y332LX6Uq2OkUAh0g&oe=69FB5558"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pkrul1cnne4Q7kNvwFFVwWL&_nc_oc=AdoJf1WfPeowKaQ7tkYdejZLQIID2V8q76ngQaKapy6LTfx2R_aHYmwenqZSjymNqmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4XRZZR4ZfSGtTd8BcgX4yVEoBAk45S1s60vCSmu9KXlA&oe=69FB303C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080